Source corrections (our copy of the pack source differs from the author's)
  xSLIMFIREpopups.xml:5 MainInfoViewPopup X: "MainRightOuterEdge.RIGHT-15" -> "ResizeRight.RIGHT-15". xSLIMFIRE's main window has no MainRightOuterEdge tile (Xfire's own loader refuses a missing anchor tile: "XML Skin matching component (%ws) not found"); its right outer edge tile is ResizeRight (xSLIMFIREmainwindow.xml:38, JustX=RIGHT ResizeY=100). Plan SK2 lead decision 54.
